Perform for the recommended amount of repetitions, switch arms and repeat the movement.','ARMS',ARRAY['ARMS']::text[],ARRAY['forearms']::text[],ARRAY['DUMBBELL']::text[],'strength','unilateral',NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/Seated_One-Arm_Dumbbell_Palms-Up_Wrist_Curl/0.jpg',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'free-exercise-db','Seated_One-Arm_Dumbbell_Palms-Up_Wrist_Curl','Unlicense',NULL,'https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db'),
('Seated_Overhead_Stretch','Seated Overhead Stretch','Seated Overhead Stretch','Sit up straight on an exercise mat.
Touch the soles of your feet together with your feet six to eight inches in front of your hips.
Place one hand on the floor beside you and your other hand behind your head.
Lift your elbow to the ceiling as you incline your torso to the other side. Hold for 10 to 20 seconds, then switch sides.','CORE',ARRAY['CORE']::text[],ARRAY['core']::text[],'{}'::text[],'stretching',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/Seated_Overhead_Stretch/0.jpg',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'free-exercise-db','Seated_Overhead_Stretch','Unlicense',NULL,'https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db'),
('Seated_Palm-Up_Barbell_Wrist_Curl','Seated Palm-Up Barbell Wrist Curl','Seated Palm-Up Barbell Wrist Curl','Hold a barbell with both hands and your palms facing up; hands spaced about shoulder width.
Place your feet flat on the floor, at a distance that is slightly wider than shoulder width apart.
Lean forward and place your forearms on top of your upper thighs with your palms up. Tip: Make sure that the front of the wrists lay on top of your knees. This will be your starting position.
Lower the bar as far as possible while inhaling and keeping a tight grip.
Now curl bar up as high as possible while flexing the forearms and exhaling. Hold the contraction at the top for a second and Tip: Only the wrist should move.','ARMS',ARRAY['ARMS']::text[],ARRAY['forearms']::text[],ARRAY['BARBELL']::text[],'strength',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/Seated_Palm-Up_Barbell_Wrist_Curl/0.jpg',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'free-exercise-db','Seated_Palm-Up_Barbell_Wrist_Curl','Unlicense',NULL,'https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db'),
