('Shoulder_Raise','Shoulder Raise','Shoulder Raise','Relax your arms to your sides and raise your shoulders up toward your ears, then back down.','SHOULDERS',ARRAY['SHOULDERS','BACK']::text[],ARRAY['shoulders','lats']::text[],'{}'::text[],'stretching',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/Shoulder_Raise/0.jpg',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'free-exercise-db','Shoulder_Raise','Unlicense',NULL,'https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db'),
