Bring the weights toward your lower chest/stomach','CHEST',ARRAY['CHEST','ARMS','SHOULDERS']::text[],ARRAY['chest','triceps','shoulders']::text[],ARRAY['DUMBBELL']::text[],'Chest',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_1353/0.webp',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1353','CC-BY-SA 4','Anastasious','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_1360','Double Kettlebell Clean and Press','Double Kettlebell Clean and Press','Full-body muscles building exercise. This exercise provides a huge range of benefits in terms of strength & size and is extremely functional.','SHOULDERS',ARRAY['SHOULDERS','ARMS','LEGS','BACK','CORE']::text[],ARRAY['shoulders','biceps','quads','triceps','hamstrings','glutes','lats','core']::text[],ARRAY['KETTLEBELL']::text[],'Arms','bilateral',NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1360','CC-BY-SA 4','m4k3r','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
