('wger_1503','Dumbbell Frog Press','Dumbbell Frog Press','Similar to hip thrust, but with feet put up together, lifting the butt off the ground in a frog like position.','LEGS',ARRAY['LEGS']::text[],ARRAY['glutes']::text[],ARRAY['DUMBBELL']::text[],'Legs',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1503','CC-BY-SA 4','JohnPreston','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_1504','Dumbbell Bradford press','Dumbbell Bradford press','From a front hold of the DBs in a OHP, press above the head, bring back towards the rear of the shoulders, down, and press back forward.','SHOULDERS',ARRAY['SHOULDERS']::text[],ARRAY['shoulders']::text[],ARRAY['DUMBBELL']::text[],'Shoulders',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1504','CC-BY-SA 4','JohnPreston','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_1508','High-Incline Smith Machine Press','High-Incline Smith Machine Press','Set the bench to a 45-60° incline. Touch the upper chest with the bar.','SHOULDERS',ARRAY['SHOULDERS','CHEST','ARMS']::text[],ARRAY['shoulders','chest','triceps']::text[],'{}'::text[],'Chest',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1508','CC-BY-SA 4','Expenses7000','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_1509','Cable Tricep Kickback','Cable Tricep Kickback','Grab onto the handle, and pull your elbow up and back slightly above
your torso. Keep your upper arm to be parallel to the ground for the
