('wger_1638','Barbell Clean and press','Barbell Clean and press','This exercise involves lifting a barbell from the ground to the shoulders, then pressing it overhead. It is a compound movement that targets multiple muscle groups, including the legs, back, shoulders, and arms. It is often used in strength and conditioning programs to improve overall power and athleticism.','SHOULDERS',ARRAY['SHOULDERS','CHEST']::text[],ARRAY['shoulders','chest']::text[],ARRAY['DUMBBELL']::text[],'Shoulders',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_1638/0.webp',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1638','CC-BY-SA 4','Rottekongen','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_1639','Dumbbell Bent Over Face Pull','Dumbbell Bent Over Face Pull','This exercise involves using dumbbells to perform a bent over face pull, which targets the upper back and shoulders. The movement involves pulling the weights towards the face while keeping the elbows high and squeezing the shoulder blades together.','SHOULDERS',ARRAY['SHOULDERS','BACK']::text[],ARRAY['shoulders','lats']::text[],ARRAY['DUMBBELL']::text[],'Back',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_1639/0.webp',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1639','CC-BY-SA 4','AlucardEvil40','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_1640','Dumbbell Front Squat','Dumbbell Front Squat','This exercise involves holding a dumbbell in each hand at shoulder height and performing a squat. It targets the lower body muscles, including the quads, hamstrings, and glutes, while also engaging the core and upper body.','LEGS',ARRAY['LEGS','SHOULDERS','CORE']::text[],ARRAY['glutes','quads','shoulders','core']::text[],ARRAY['DUMBBELL']::text[],'Legs',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_1640/0.webp',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1640','CC-BY-SA 4','AlucardEvil40','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
