('wger_1653','Dumbbell Side Squat','Dumbbell Side Squat','This exercise involves holding a dumbbell in one hand and performing a squat while stepping to the side. It targets the legs, glutes, and core muscles.','LEGS',ARRAY['LEGS']::text[],ARRAY['glutes','quads','hamstrings']::text[],'{}'::text[],'Legs',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_1653/0.webp',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1653','CC-BY-SA 4','AlucardEvil40','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_1654','Machine Lateral Raise','Machine Lateral Raise','The machine lateral raise is an isolation exercise that targets the medial (side) deltoid muscle to build wider, more defined shoulders. The machine''s fixed path of motion provides greater stability than dumbbells, making it ideal for beginners or those who want to focus solely on muscle activation.','SHOULDERS',ARRAY['SHOULDERS']::text[],ARRAY['shoulders']::text[],ARRAY['OTHER']::text[],'Shoulders',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_1654/0.jpg',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1654','CC-BY-SA 4','roneydya','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_1656','Cable Chest Press - Decline','Cable Chest Press - Decline','Single arm chest press done with the cable machine. Use the other arm to brace bodyweight to focus on strength of the press, rather than balancing of the body. Start with the hand as close to the chest as possible, and then press against the cable at a slight decline and aiming towards the center of your chest.','CHEST',ARRAY['CHEST','ARMS']::text[],ARRAY['chest','triceps']::text[],ARRAY['OTHER']::text[],'Chest',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1656','CC-BY-SA 4','Shiladree','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
