('wger_1659','Lat Pulldown - Cross Body Single Arm','Lat Pulldown - Cross Body Single Arm','Sit at lat pulldown machine with body at a diagonal angle so that only one leg is under the pad. Pull the cable down with the opposite arm. this will force the cable to across your body while pulling down. Emphasises the stretch of the lat.','BACK',ARRAY['BACK']::text[],ARRAY['lats']::text[],ARRAY['OTHER']::text[],'Back','unilateral',NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1659','CC-BY-SA 4','Shiladree','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
