('wger_172','Crunches on Machine','Crunches on Machine','The procedure is very similar as for regular crunches, only with the additional weight of the machine. Sit on the machine, put both feet firmly on the ground. Grab the to the weights, cables, etc. and do a rolling motion forwards (the spine should ideally lose touch vertebra by vertebra). Slowly return to the starting position.','CORE',ARRAY['CORE']::text[],ARRAY['core']::text[],'{}'::text[],'Abs',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','172','CC-BY-SA 3','wger.de','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_1723','Glute Kickback (Machine)','Glute Kickback (Machine)','Drive through your heel, not your toes, to hit the glute.

Don’t hyperextend your lower back at the top.','LEGS',ARRAY['LEGS']::text[],ARRAY['glutes']::text[],'{}'::text[],'Legs',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1723','CC-BY-SA 4','barry','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_1724','Standing Adduction (Cable)','Standing Adduction (Cable)','Keep your hips square and still, pulling the cable across your opposing leg using only your inner thigh.

Don’t let your torso lean or twist — no side bending to help the rep.','CORE',ARRAY['CORE']::text[],'{}'::text[],ARRAY['OTHER']::text[],'Legs',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1724','CC-BY-SA 4','barry','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
