('wger_1727','Side Straight-Arm Pulldown (Cable)','Side Straight-Arm Pulldown (Cable)','Keep your torso still, pulling the handle down along your side using the outer lat.

Don’t twist your body or rotate your torso to cheat the rep.','BACK',ARRAY['BACK']::text[],ARRAY['lats']::text[],ARRAY['OTHER']::text[],'Back',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1727','CC-BY-SA 4','barry','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_1728','Shoulder Internal Rotation (Cable)','Shoulder Internal Rotation (Cable)','Keep your elbow tucked to your side like it''s superglued there.

