('wger_1807','Behind the Back Cable Lateral Raise','Behind the Back Cable Lateral Raise','Lateral raises have long been a staple for building capped delts, and lifters use everything from dumbbells and bands to machines and single-arm variations to make them grow.','SHOULDERS',ARRAY['SHOULDERS']::text[],ARRAY['shoulders']::text[],ARRAY['OTHER']::text[],'Shoulders',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','1807','CC-BY-SA 4','LEBRERO','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
