('wger_478','Push Press','Push Press','Clean your dumbbells onto your shoulders, palms facing in. Take a breath and brace your core. (picture 1)Dip at the knees and use your legs to help (picture 2) press your dumbbells overhead. Lower under control with a slow tempo to your shoulders and repeat.','LEGS',ARRAY['LEGS']::text[],ARRAY['glutes']::text[],'{}'::text[],'Shoulders',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_478/0.jpg',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','478','CC-BY-SA 3','sistab2','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_48','Barbell Reverse Wrist Curl','Barbell Reverse Wrist Curl','Sitting on a bench, grab a barbell with your palms facing down and your hands shoulder-width apart. Rest your forearms on your thighs and allow your wrists to hang over your knees.

Curl your knuckles towards your face, lifting the barbell. Pause for a moment in the top position, then slowly return the barbell to the starting position.','CORE',ARRAY['CORE']::text[],'{}'::text[],ARRAY['BARBELL','BENCH']::text[],'Arms',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','48','CC-BY-SA 4','burenl','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_484','Rack Deadlift','Rack Deadlift','Deadlift to be done using a Smith machine or a free rack. Bar or barbell hould be just right under the knee cap level. Lift using the glutes and through the heels, then come back to starting postion with a control movement of 2 seconds.

This exercise targets mainly the lower back and glutes.','LEGS',ARRAY['LEGS','ARMS']::text[],ARRAY['glutes','biceps']::text[],'{}'::text[],'Back',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_484/0.png',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','484','CC-BY-SA 3','Mahoney','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_487','Rear Delt Raises','Rear Delt Raises','Seated on a bench with the dumbbells on the floor bend over at 45 Degrees and then slowly raise each dumbbell to shoulder height and hold for a couple seconds before lowering to the starting position.','CORE',ARRAY['CORE']::text[],'{}'::text[],ARRAY['DUMBBELL']::text[],'Shoulders',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_487/0.png',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','487','CC-BY-SA 3','YYCfit','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_490','Renegade Row','Renegade Row','Get into pushup position gripping some dumbbells. Perform one pushup, then drive your left elbo up, bringing the dumbell up to your body. Return the dumbell to starting position.

Perform another pushup and then row with the other arm to complete one rep.','BACK',ARRAY['BACK']::text[],ARRAY['lats']::text[],ARRAY['DUMBBELL']::text[],'Back',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','490','CC0','fletchgraham','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
