('wger_495','Reverse Curl','Reverse Curl','The reverse-grip barbell curl is a variation on the biceps curl where the palms face downward. The switch from an underhand to an overhand grip brings the forearm and brachialis muscles more into the exercise.','ARMS',ARRAY['ARMS']::text[],ARRAY['biceps']::text[],ARRAY['BARBELL','DUMBBELL']::text[],'Arms',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','495','CC0','BFad07','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
