('wger_804','Sloper hanging','Sloper hanging','Hanging on sloper holds of a fingerboard for a amount of seconds','CORE',ARRAY['CORE']::text[],'{}'::text[],ARRAY['OTHER']::text[],'Arms',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_804/0.png',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','804','CC-BY-SA 4','marcelbader','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_805','Tricep Pushdown on Cable','Tricep Pushdown on Cable','The cable rope push-down is a popular exercise targeting the triceps muscles. It''s easy to learn and perform, making it a favorite for everyone from beginners to advanced lifters. It is usually performed for moderate to high reps, such as 8-12 reps or more per set, as part of an upper-body or arm-focused workout.','ARMS',ARRAY['ARMS']::text[],ARRAY['triceps']::text[],ARRAY['OTHER']::text[],'Arms',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_805/0.png',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','805','CC-BY-SA 4','cshep442','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_81','Bent Over Dumbbell Rows','Bent Over Dumbbell Rows','With dumbbells in hand, bend at the hip until hands hang just below the knees (similar to straight-legged-deadlift starting position). Keep upper body angle constant while contracting your lats to pull you ellbows back pinching the shoulder blades at the top. Try not to stand up with every rep, check hands go below knees on every rep.','BACK',ARRAY['BACK']::text[],ARRAY['lats']::text[],ARRAY['BENCH','DUMBBELL']::text[],'Back',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_81/0.png',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','81','CC-BY-SA 4','sebk','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_82','Bent-over Lateral Raises','Bent-over Lateral Raises','Sit on bench while holding weights. Bend forward as far as possible, with arms slightly bent at the elbow. Perform a lateral raise while maintaining the bend in your elbow.','CORE',ARRAY['CORE']::text[],'{}'::text[],ARRAY['BENCH','DUMBBELL']::text[],'Shoulders',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','82','CC-BY-SA 4','apeschel','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
