('wger_909','Reverse Nordic Curl','Reverse Nordic Curl','Natural Leg Extension is alternative to Leg Extension machine with no equipment.','LEGS',ARRAY['LEGS','CORE']::text[],ARRAY['quads','glutes','core']::text[],'{}'::text[],'Legs',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_909/0.png',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','909','CC-BY-SA 4','karly','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_91','Biceps Curls With Barbell','Biceps Curls With Barbell','Hold the Barbell shoulder-wide, the back is straight, the shoulders slightly back, the arms are streched. Bend the arms, bringing the weight up, with a fast movement. Without pausing, let down the bar with a slow and controlled movement.

Don''t allow your body to swing during the exercise, all work is done by the biceps, which are the only mucles that should move (pay attention to the elbows).','ARMS',ARRAY['ARMS']::text[],ARRAY['biceps']::text[],ARRAY['BARBELL']::text[],'Arms',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],'https://ilzlswmatadlnsuxatcv.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/exercise-media/wger_91/0.png',FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','91','CC-BY-SA 3','wger.de','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_910','Nordic Curl','Nordic Curl','The Nordic hamstring curl is one of the best lower-body exercises to build posterior leg strength, improve knee health, and prevent injury.','LEGS',ARRAY['LEGS']::text[],ARRAY['hamstrings','glutes']::text[],'{}'::text[],'Legs',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','910','CC-BY-SA 4','karly','https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
