Keep circling your arms as described in step 1.','CORE',ARRAY['CORE']::text[],'{}'::text[],ARRAY['OTHER']::text[],'Arms',NULL,NULL,NULL,'EITHER',NULL,0,'{}'::text[],NULL,FALSE,FALSE,NULL,'wger','994','CC-BY-SA 4',NULL,'https://wger.de/en/software/api'),
('wger_995','Backward arm circles','Backward arm circles','Starting position:

